  "ruleText": "Ac 302.08 Denial of Application. An applicant who has been denied a license shall be provided an opportunity for an administrative hearing before the board in accordance with the requirements of Plc 200.\n\nSource. #14399, eff 12-5-25, EXPIRES: 12-5-35",
